{'symbol': 'MRNA', 'date': '2022-02-09 15:05:00', 'title': 'MODERNA CHIEF TECHNICAL OPERATIONS AND QUALITY OFFICER JUAN ANDRES ELECTED TO NATIONAL ACADEMY OF ENGINEERING', 'text': 'CAMBRIDGE, MA / ACCESSWIRE / FEBRUARY 9, 2022 / MODERNA, INC. (NASDAQ:MRNA), A BIOTECHNOLOGY COMPANY PIONEERING MESSENGER RNA (MRNA) THERAPEUTICS AND VACCINES, TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT JUAN ANDRES, CHIEF TECHNICAL OPERATIONS AND QUALITY OFFICER, HAS BEEN ELECTED TO THE NATIONAL ACADEMY OF ENGINEERING (NAE), BROADLY RECOGNIZED AS ONE OF THE HIGHEST ACKNOWLEDGMENTS OF ACHIEVEMENT IN THE FIELD OF ENGINEERING. "WE ARE DELIGHTED THAT THE NATIONAL ACADEMY OF ENGINEERING HAS RECOGNIZED JUAN FOR HIS OUTSTANDING CONTRIBUTIONS.'}